flowchart LR
  Env[Raw environment bindings] --> Policy[Validated RuntimePolicy]
  Request[Internet request] --> RouteTable[Closed route table]
  Policy --> RouteTable
  Policy --> Provider[Fixed provider capability]
  Policy --> Origins[Canonical origin set]
  Policy --> Disable[Deploy-time Live disable state and reason]
  RouteTable --> Admission[Typed admission policy]
  Admission --> API[API and WebSocket]
  Admission --> Map[Map assets]
  Provider --> Upstream[Three fixed provider paths]
  Headers[Checked-in static security headers] --> Browser[Browser]
  Runbooks[Disable, quota, terms, stale feed, rollback] --> Policy
  Tests[Contract and artifact policy tests] --> Policy
